      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e758310255bf002adc95bbff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我环顾房间四周，\n在柜子上看到了美浦波旁小时候的照片。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dca0ce8ba63dd199a85de11ca9d48d19f768ce09f96ff20574001c73b2597595",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b17245f96c32f43822da608b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面无表情地拿着第一名的奖旗，\n并比出胜利手势，完全就是美浦波旁的风格。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5c7ebc3e0d3a167960d135f908f30b83d08571657b8218989c0b06deed3b412",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026111.json",
      "json_path": [
