    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee50ccf879c50366b3e56d68",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是我刚以经典三冠为目标的时期，\n因此拿到第一名的我很“开心”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1a2bbbaf6c2fca169ad263a0664327dc468d32074996cdb012a48df810db932",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:500caec28db878fdb43bec3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其他还摆有奖章、奖杯，\n以及应该是美浦波旁小时候画的图画之类，\n布置在房间各处──",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbd4b4af51a403aa83bbf6e696786a2c8db9cbd75ae3bae2e4050dcb316086f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0fcc6eaf97cbda2bd293e50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "68576f613f1377730d458753942253737f9ca764fce0d1beaa08c13001c943b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2afd89ff4c3a739f42071f9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当中让我特别注意到的是\n一张老旧的“日本德比”当日票券。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39bed5cb2ea4bc83d05cb9ddceec34f0abf0a56bfe9d261a06a40be3d4562ecf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f2c0da30083130b0a13f4ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美浦波旁",
      "source_fingerprint": "d31aaadb85fb817a2c53dd55829df1a4c71dc82c8dd7c457754c51af5729ede3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026111.json",
      "json_path": [
