      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24153e1845fe01cf930ea974",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为女儿不在身边，我就把它拿出来放着。\n被Master看到我这样思念女儿真是不好意思……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b476a940b62e4a910577f72c38b964903d281fecf30022d3d5e414d1bda1018",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34ac8bb1c959094d89814075",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是我变成要去美浦波旁的老家一趟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7bb945d5372d3567c59a6608c761e873a52de38261508b9a25d7d887356ccd3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff96523a6939cd968bbeac7c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "波旁的父亲",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2305406052b6df94b885256c1f049c435c2334025781db7d4e7eba0145879da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026111.json",
      "json_path": [
